{"type": "assistant", "id": "5047ae9c-d8fe-4903-b129-77a8783d0fdd", "ts": "2026-01-07T07:59:01Z", "text": "The twin meadow reaches past the northern orchard.", "tokens": 2270}
{"type": "assistant", "id": "11bf20ed-54d8-4cba-89b7-30568081a008", "ts": "2026-01-07T08:00:37Z", "text": "The hazy clover returns under a nimble marsh near the cove.", "tokens": 2652}
{"type": "user", "id": "c8cf8412-bf91-47a4-b641-e01abe245ee3", "ts": "2026-01-07T08:13:32Z", "text": "The falcon crosses beside the clover, and the wheat settles."}
{"type": "user", "id": "bb85ff33-6ad4-46a7-aa5f-f4b292da03ba", "ts": "2026-01-07T08:14:32Z", "text": "The mellow cedar follows past the rapid dune."}
